these pesky ghosts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_7","text":"Sounds like you've become quite the professional ghost hunter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_8","text":"Hehe, you bet I have!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_9","text":"Althooough... there's just one teeny-tiny problem.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_10","text":"The BFG is outfitted with a storage unit that holds all the captured ghosts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_11","text":"But it's completely filled to the brim right now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_12","text":"If I don't clear it out, I can kiss catching ghosts goodbye... Heck, it might even go BOOM!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_13","text":"So I was hoping you'd be able to help me out, Mr. Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_14","text":"Huh? How?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_15","text":"The BFG has a function that lets you clear out the storage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_16","text":"Basically, it merges ghosts of the same type, converts them into energy, and feeds that energy back into the BFG.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_17","text":"Uh... I don't think I'm qualified for this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_18","text":"Don't worry, I made the whole process super fun. It'll be like playing a game!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_19","text":"For a pro gamer like you, this'll be a piece of cake.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_20","text":"I guess I am pretty good at video games...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_21","text":"Hehe, you totally are!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_22","text":"Oh, on the off chance—a very slight off chance, mind you—that you're afraid of ghosts...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_23","text":"I've converted them into more friendly-looking shapes!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_24","text":"So just relax and play the game... I mean, help me with the cleanup!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_25","text":"... Much appreciated. All right, I'll give it a shot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_bfgcleanup_01_26","text":"Hehe. Sweet! I'll be counting on you then!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}